WROTE A.bi ONLY (-signature-only)
WROTE A.bi A.bcheck ONLY (-check-only)
IDENTICAL A.bi (-signature-only, -check-only)
TAG A.bi bsc-bi-20261102-1
TAG A.bcheck bsc-bcheck-20261102-2
SAME-PACKAGE dumpbo A.bcheck, -dliftdicts
LIFTED-DICTIONARIES-IN A.bcheck (dumpbo -stats)
DEPENDS A.bcheck Prelude PreludeBSV
WROTE Kinded.bcheck (kind-annotated type parameters)
SAME-PACKAGE dumpbo Kinded.bcheck, -dliftdicts
LET-STATEMENT-IN Defaults -dliftdicts (class default method)
SAME-PACKAGE dumpbo Defaults.bcheck, -dliftdicts
IDENTICAL A.bcheck (recompiled)
IDENTICAL A.bcheck (two directories, -remap-path-prefix)
NO-DIRECTORY-IN A.bcheck (-remap-path-prefix)
DIFFER A.bcheck (two directories, no -remap-path-prefix)
DIRECTORY-IN A.bcheck
IDENTICAL A.bi (body-only edit)
DIFFER A.bcheck (body-only edit)
DIFFER A.bi (interface edit)
DIFFER A.bcheck (interface edit)
IDENTICAL A.bi (other directory)
IDENTICAL A.bi (absolute path)
NO-DIRECTORY-IN A.bi
IDENTICAL A.bo (A.bi present)
IDENTICAL B.bo (A.bi present or absent)
SAME-SIGNATURE dumpbo -bi A.bo A.bi
DEPENDS A.bi Prelude PreludeBSV
